<title>JAPAN: Regal Corp - 6mth parent results.</title>
<headline>Regal Corp - 6mth parent results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to September 30, 1996</p>
<p> (Parent)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		 23.95		vs	   24.89</p>
<p> Operating   loss 264    million    vs	prft 158 million</p>
<p> Current     loss 410    million    vs	 prft 23 million</p>
<p> Net	   loss 465    million    vs	 prft 16 million</p>
<p> EPS	    loss 16.93 yen	  vs     prft 0.60 yen</p>
<p> Shares	     28 million	  vs	  28 million</p>
<p> Interim div	   nil		vs	     nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Regal Corp is the largest leather shoe maker.</p>
</text>
